      "text": "- its like whatsapp\n- client generate the position on thir own.\n- and send to websocket.\n- it persist in queue for async processing\n  and low latency. \n- and then broadcast to live collaborator.\n- save call from client works synchronously.\n- it call to doc grpc server and save the doc.",
